./ R 01090000          $ 01090100 100                                           
         L     R10,VMSEG-VMBLOK(,R10)   SYSTEM ADDR SPACE      XA0036DK         
         N     R10,=A(SEGSTOM) WITHOUT THE LENGTH              XA0036DK         
./ R 01093000          $ 01093100 100                                           
*  WAS X'00FF0000'. X'7FF00000' IS DMKVAT'S OWN CODEB0         XA0036DK         
*  SEGMENT MASK -- LARGE PAGE, LARGE SEG, FULLWORD ENTRIES --  XA0036DK         
*  AND THE SRL 18 BELOW IS CODEB0'S SEGSHFT. I-188:            XA0036DK         
*  X'00F00000' REACHES ONLY SIXTEEN SEGMENTS, WHICH IS A 16    XA0036DK         
*  MB MACHINE AND NOT AN ARCHITECTURE. R9 HOLDS A(DMKSYM), A   XA0036DK         
*  CLEAN NUCLEUS ADDRESS, SO THE WIDER MASK CANNOT PICK UP A   XA0036DK         
*  DIRTY HIGH BYTE HERE.                                       XA0036DK         
         L     R8,=A(X'7FF00000') ...TO GET THE SEGMENT NO.    XA0036DK         
./ R 01096000          $ 01096100 100                                           
         SRL   R8,18(0)       CONVERT TO SEGTABLE INDEX        XA0036DK         
